From: Codex local compatibility adaptation
Subject: [PATCH] Adapt existing SehLights backport to A376B Android 16

Reason: attempt8.txt:1104-1105 and :1132-1133 show the upstream SehLights patch does not apply to AZH4 services.jar. Keep the A37 VintfHalCache API, retain two-argument callers, and forward the backlight extension mode.
